  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">Our story</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Eating well is mostly plain meals.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Eiyo Clinic is a nutrition and dietetics practice for adults in Seattle, founded in 2016 by registered dietitian Ingrid Solberg around a single wooden table.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ingrid had spent years listening to adults struggle with rigid diets and contradictory rules. Her premise was straightforward: lasting health is built from ordinary, repeatable meals that people actually enjoy making, not strict plans that collapse under everyday stress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Today the clinic occupies one floor at 418 Alder Row, Suite 2, with three quiet consult rooms and a teaching kitchen. Seven people work here: five dietitians and cooks with their own areas of focus, and a front desk coordinator.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We say dietitian, never doctor. We work alongside your own doctor, we do not promise outcomes, and every plan is written by hand with you in the room.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "approach",
   "title": "Approach",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">How a consult runs</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">A plan written with you, not for you.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">One first consult, a handwritten plan and a few follow-ups. No forbidden foods, no calorie counting.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Book and keep a three-day food note</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Book online or by phone. We send a short three-day food note to fill in with what you actually eat.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. First consult, 60 minutes</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We read the note together, look at the habits that stall, and agree on two or three adjustments you can keep.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Written plan within 2 working days</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You leave with a handwritten plan, and a typed copy follows within 2 working days.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Follow-ups at weeks 2, 6 and 12</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Short check-ins to adjust the plan around real weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "services",
   "title": "Services",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">What we offer</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Seven ways to work with us.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Individual consults, family meals, a grocery walk and small kitchen classes. Prices are in USD.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-feelist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-feelist\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">First consult</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">60 min, three-day food note reviewed, handwritten plan + typed copy within 2 working days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$120</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Follow-up</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">30 min, in person</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$65</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Video follow-up</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">30 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$60</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Three-month plan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">First consult + 3 follow-ups (weeks 2, 6, 12) + written plan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$295</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Family meals consult</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">75 min, up to 4 household members</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$150</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Grocery walk</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">45 min, at a store near the clinic</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$80</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Kitchen class</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">2 hours, small group of up to 6, per person</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$45</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Payment by card. An itemised receipt (superbill) is available for your insurer on request; we do not bill insurers directly. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "dietitians",
   "title": "Dietitians",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">The people in the room</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Seven people, one wooden table.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Five dietitians and cooks with their own areas of focus, and the front desk.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ingrid Solberg</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Founder, registered dietitian</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Ingrid founded Eiyo Clinic in 2016 to help adults build calm, sustainable eating habits through plain everyday food. She leads initial consultations and mentors the clinical team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tomás Ávila</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Dietitian, blood sugar and cholesterol</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tomás works alongside primary physicians to help clients with realistic dietary adjustments, manageable pantry staples and consistent daily routines.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Amara Nwosu</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Dietitian, family meals</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amara helps households with differing tastes and schedules build shared meals without preparing separate dinners.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Leila Haddad</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Dietitian, shift work and eating out</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Leila supports clients with irregular hours and frequent travel: portable meals, convenient lunches and strategies for dining out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Daniel Brennan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Dietitian, plant-forward eating</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Daniel helps clients bring more vegetables, legumes and whole grains into regular cooking, with approachable techniques.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Priya Raman</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Cook, leads the kitchen classes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Priya leads small-group cooking sessions in the clinic kitchen: foundational prep, simple vegetable dishes and relaxed home cooking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sofia Marchetti</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__role\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__role\">Front desk and bookings</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sofia manages appointments and enquiries, and sends your three-day food note and typed care summary on time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "fees",
   "title": "Fees",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">Fees and insurance</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Fees, plainly.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Every price is listed here and identical to what you will be charged.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-feelist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-feelist\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">First consult</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">60 min, three-day food note reviewed, handwritten plan + typed copy within 2 working days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$120</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Follow-up</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">30 min, in person</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$65</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Video follow-up</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">30 min</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$60</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Three-month plan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">First consult + 3 follow-ups (weeks 2, 6, 12) + written plan</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$295</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Family meals consult</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">75 min, up to 4 household members</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$150</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Grocery walk</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">45 min, at a store near the clinic</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$80</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-fee\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-fee\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__name\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__name\">Kitchen class</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__note\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__note\">2 hours, small group of up to 6, per person</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-fee__price\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-fee__price\">$45</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Payment by card. An itemised receipt (superbill) is available for your insurer on request; we do not bill insurers directly. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">Visit and contact</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Come and sit down with us.</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">418 Alder Row, Suite 2, Seattle, WA 98103.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Phone: (206) 555-0143</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Email: hello@eiyoclinic.example</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hours: Mon–Fri 8:30–18:00 (Thu until 20:00); Sat 9:00–13:00; closed Sun and public holidays.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To book, call or email and we will send the three-day food note.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "stories",
   "title": "Stories",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">Stories</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Three ordinary weeks</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Short accounts of what changed at the table. Names are fictional and nothing here predicts your own results.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mark, 54 — breakfast back on the table</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Mark had spent years skipping breakfast, running on coffee until mid-morning hunger took over. Working with Tomás, he established an unhurried morning bowl of warm porridge and fruit, a breakfast he now makes most mornings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rosa, 38 — a lunch for night shifts</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hospital night shifts left Rosa reliant on vending machines at three in the morning. Leila helped her design a packed thermal lunch that stays fresh for twelve hours, a lunch she now prepares before each rotation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Okafor household — one dinner for everyone</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amara worked with a family whose members ate at different hours and tastes, and built a short list of shared dinners that adapt at the table instead of being cooked twice.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "faq",
   "title": "FAQ",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"section\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"ec-sec ec-page\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignfull ec-sec ec-page\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"ec-in ec-page__in\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ec-in ec-page__in\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-eyebrow\">FAQ</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"className\":\"ec-h2 ec-page__title\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading ec-h2 ec-page__title\">Questions we are often asked</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"ec-page__lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"ec-page__lead\">Short, plain answers about booking, plans and payment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do I need a referral?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. We work alongside your own doctor, and are happy to share your plan with them if you ask.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What happens before the first consult?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We send a three-day food note to fill in with what you actually eat. The 60-minute first consult is $120.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Do you bill insurance?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We do not bill insurers directly. An itemised receipt (superbill) is available on request. Payment is by card.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Can I cancel?</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, free up to 24 hours before your appointment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"
  },
